  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごい人だな……\r\nこの列に並ぶつもりなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もっちろん！\r\nそのために、あんたを連れてきたんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "仕事だって、\r\nばっちり巻きで終わらせたんだしね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（確かに……\r\nさっきまでの仕事、いつも以上のやる気だったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一体、何をそんなに……\r\n……ん？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0461"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "この画面、見て",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと……\r\n『「ミラクル♡ミラージュ」缶バッジ発売のお知らせ』？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そう！　この超可愛い\r\n店舗限定ランダム缶バッジ、今日発売なの！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ひとり５個までなんだけど、\r\nあんたも一緒に並べば10個買えるでしょ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほど、そういうことだったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "きっとすぐ売り切れちゃうだろうし、\r\n絶対に今日確保しときたかったってわけ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでこの人だかりか……\r\nそれに、みんな楽しそうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "当たり前じゃない！　久しぶりの新作グッズ！\r\nみんな今日を楽しみにしてたんだからっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？　でも、一緒に来るのは\r\n俺じゃなくてもよかったんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子の知り合いなら、\r\nアニメを知ってて一緒に並んでくれる人もいるだろうし",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子だって、このアニメがわかる人と\r\n並んでたほうが楽しいだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……それは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………その、\r\nこのアニメが好きって、誰にも言ってないんだもん……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "他の、人気で……みんなも好きなアニメは\r\n適当に好きって言って、話合わせたりするけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "このアニメは……\r\n好きって言うの、なんか怖かったから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800302/2018003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そういうことか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003020130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……そ、その点、あんたなんか\r\n別に気を遣う必要ないから！",
